    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2022-tame-02: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.63";
    dc:description "Behavioral retention after brain regeneration is operationalizable, and several published studies provide relevant measurements. Their small samples, methodological heterogeneity, and alternative explanations make the general claim only partly resolvable.";
