    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare pre- and post-regeneration performance of trained and untrained planaria on the same behavioral assay, controlling for retraining, handling, innate bias, and regenerated sensory capacity.";
