    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Historical studies use heterogeneous and sometimes disputed training assays.", "Post-regeneration performance can reflect bias or rapid relearning rather than transferred memory.", "Raw trial-level data are sparse.";
